    width: 190
    height: 135
  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Elias
    Text: The church oversees us and works closely with us. Even if other Kingdoms
      doubt us they respect the church. It is the most neutral body we can bring
      in to hopefully ease off any tension. As well as they need to bless and prepare
      the body for the funeral.
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8d4c4129234cbc8459cd35ec1489f0f7, type: 3}
  ParentNodes:
