  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Elias
    Text: "Hello, Nikolaus! Me and Allistair are just here looking through the royal
      decree. You know times like these are a bit unprecedented and we hope something
      in it can help guide us. A shame what happened truly\u2026"
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8d4c4129234cbc8459cd35ec1489f0f7, type: 3}
