    y: 57
    width: 190
    height: 135
  IsDragging: 1
  IsSelected: 0
  _sentence:
    CharacterName: Elias
    Text: 'Avant contacted the Head Priest and ordered a shut down. No one is to
      be let in or out. The borders of the Kingdom are also closed off. It happened
      too soon, I think the murderer is still here because they left the murder weapon
      lying around, a shoddy job. '
    CharacterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 8d4c4129234cbc8459cd35ec1489f0f7, type: 3}
  ParentNodes:
  - {fileID: -5164880655037716705}
  ChildNode: {fileID: -6367515031138170138}
